# Line endings are LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# core.autocrlf=true would check these files out as CRLF, and the preset reader
# parses YAML text with `\n`-anchored patterns: a CRLF checkout silently stopped
# the worker preset from activating once already. Pin it here so the checkout
# cannot reintroduce that failure on another machine.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
